        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tim O'Kelly, Charles Whitman\n- Concepts: casting reasons, character inspiration, physical resemblance, mass murderers\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Whitman was born on June 24, 1941, and died on August 1, 1966.\n- Charles Whitman was an American mass murderer who became infamous as the \"Texas Tower Sniper.\"\n- A character associated with Tim O'Kelly was loosely based on Charles Whitman.\n- Tim O'Kelly was cast because of his boy-next-door looks and his physical resemblance to Charles Whitman.",
